  ],
  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You can now retain your backup of Azure Files shares for 10 years by using Azure Backup, through <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/backup/backup-azure-afs-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PowerShell</a>. Azure Backup also supports backup and restore of ACLs of Azure Files shares.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Check out more details in the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/azure-backup-now-supports-powershell-and-acls-for-azure-files/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog post</a><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/azure-backup-now-supports-powershell-and-acls-for-azure-files/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now retain your backup of Azure Files shares for 10 years by using Azure Backup, through PowerShell . Azure Backup also supports backup and restore of ACLs of Azure Files shares.\n\nCheck out more details in the blog post ."
  },
